    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's simple:</strong><br>A mysterious box is locked with a 4 to 8-digit code.<br>Your only goal is to open it\u2014with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints. No puzzles.<br>But who needs them? If you try every number up to 9999...<br><strong>eventually, it <i>will</i> open.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about perseverance, pattern, and reward.<br>Can you crack the code?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming &amp; Monetization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, record, and monetize</strong> content featuring this game\u2014whether it's Let's Plays, walkthroughs, reviews, or anything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no restrictions</strong> on monetization methods, including ads, super chats, or other forms of support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to request explicit permission for any reason, feel free to contact us via <strong>X (formerly Twitter)</strong> or <strong>email</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the \u25b2 and \u25bc buttons to change digits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use arrow keys (\u2190/\u2192 to move, \u2191/\u2193 to change digits).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>Space</strong> or <strong>Enter</strong>, or click the treasure chest to submit your guess.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the input matches the code, the chest opens.<br><strong>Game cleared\u2014and you earn generous rewards!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though there are no hints, <strong>coins</strong> and <strong>gems</strong> will occasionally fall during gameplay.<br>These can be spent on <strong>optional skills</strong> to boost your efficiency just a little.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are purchased via the <strong>title screen</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They remain active until manually disabled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using them is optional\u2014<strong>you can still clear the game without them!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Options</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>4 to 8-digit</strong> code lengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each digit length has <strong>its own save slot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely switch between difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only one save file per digit length</strong> is allowed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer the code, the <strong>greater the reward</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing without using any skills also boosts your final reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serious Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Serious Mode</strong>, all skills are disabled.<br>But in return, the rewards <strong>skyrocket</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode is designed for players who want <strong>maximum challenge and maximum payout</strong>.<br>Clearing this mode also counts as completing Normal Mode for <strong>Steam achievements</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tutorial</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, basic tutorial is included.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a 3-digit version of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for learning controls and game flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takes just a few minutes to complete</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's simple:</strong><br>A mysterious box is locked with a 4 to 8-digit code.<br>Your only goal is to open it\u2014with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hints. No puzzles.<br>But who needs them? If you try every number up to 9999...<br><strong>eventually, it <i>will</i> open.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about perseverance, pattern, and reward.<br>Can you crack the code?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming &amp; Monetization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, record, and monetize</strong> content featuring this game\u2014whether it's Let's Plays, walkthroughs, reviews, or anything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no restrictions</strong> on monetization methods, including ads, super chats, or other forms of support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to request explicit permission for any reason, feel free to contact us via <strong>X (formerly Twitter)</strong> or <strong>email</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the \u25b2 and \u25bc buttons to change digits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use arrow keys (\u2190/\u2192 to move, \u2191/\u2193 to change digits).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press <strong>Space</strong> or <strong>Enter</strong>, or click the treasure chest to submit your guess.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the input matches the code, the chest opens.<br><strong>Game cleared\u2014and you earn generous rewards!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skills</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though there are no hints, <strong>coins</strong> and <strong>gems</strong> will occasionally fall during gameplay.<br>These can be spent on <strong>optional skills</strong> to boost your efficiency just a little.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills are purchased via the <strong>title screen</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They remain active until manually disabled</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using them is optional\u2014<strong>you can still clear the game without them!</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Options</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between <strong>4 to 8-digit</strong> code lengths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each digit length has <strong>its own save slot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can freely switch between difficulties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only one save file per digit length</strong> is allowed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer the code, the <strong>greater the reward</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clearing without using any skills also boosts your final reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Serious Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Serious Mode</strong>, all skills are disabled.<br>But in return, the rewards <strong>skyrocket</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mode is designed for players who want <strong>maximum challenge and maximum payout</strong>.<br>Clearing this mode also counts as completing Normal Mode for <strong>Steam achievements</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tutorial</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, basic tutorial is included.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features a 3-digit version of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for learning controls and game flow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Takes just a few minutes to complete</p></li></ul>",
